@startuml
title the residual window, a hypothetical termination absorbed by the ledger
participant "Broker" as B
participant "TransferRequestListener" as L
participant "accounts database" as A
participant "xfers database" as X
participant "Transaction coordinator" as C

L -> A : commit the accounts branch
L -> X : commit the xfers branch
A --> L : the balances are durable
X --> L : the transfer row and the PROCESSED_REQUESTS row are durable
note over L : the process terminates here from an external\ncause, while the Kafka transaction remains undecided
C -> C : abort the undecided transaction
C -> C : leave the consumed offset uncommitted
B -> L : deliver the same request after the restart
L -> X : consult the PROCESSED_REQUESTS table
X --> L : the request identifier is already recorded
L -> C : commit the Kafka transaction, applying no further change
@enduml
